\subsection{Robustness to the EoS populations}\label{sec:popB}
The preceding results depend on the parametrisations and priors of Table~\ref{tab:priors}. To test this, an independent population (``B'') was constructed with different functional forms and priors (Table~\ref{tab:priorsB}); the same screens, solver and experiments were applied (48 EoS per scenario, 192 in total; Table~\ref{tab:popBdata}). Population~B is still parametric rather than microphysical, so it tests sensitivity to the parametrisation, not to the underlying nuclear physics.
